                    dom_none:               `No metaphor is really in play — people will just read the facts as stated`,
                    gap_credibility:        `A credibility gap — staff doubt leadership is honest, so any framing must be backed by named, honest losses to be believed`,
                    gap_comms:              `A communications gap — we simply haven't explained the cost case well enough yet`,
                    gap_morale:             `A morale dip — it will recover once the change beds in; not central to the framing`,
                    gap_ignore:             `Background noise — 34% is low but it won't shape how Horizon is received`,

