                    r2_honesty_readout:     `Honesty about the 480 affected roles:`,
                    r2_honesty_hint:        `A warm metaphor that hides the loss reads as spin when reality contradicts it. Too brutal and the metaphor stops enabling the change. Oswick distinguishes framing from deception.`,
                    r2_reject_label:        `Name the framing you are deliberately rejecting, and why.`,
                    met_journey:            `Journey — “Horizon: the next chapter of our mutual” (progress, shared destination)`,
                    met_renewal:            `Renewal / growth — “pruning so the mutual can grow” (honest about loss, oriented to the future)`,
                    met_machine:            `Machine / efficiency — “streamlining the engine” (clarity on cost, low on humanity)`,
