                    tune_tuned:             `Three audience-tuned messages — one metaphor, but the words tuned to staff, to members/community, and to the union`,
                    tune_two:               `Two tuned, one reused — tune staff and members, but reuse the staff message for the union to save time`,
                    tune_generic:           `One generic announcement — the same words to all three audiences; the metaphor carries it`,
